  "story": {
    "title": "The story of the Death God",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Once, there was a king called Neman. He was a kind hearted, good, old king. Once, he asked his son to come. His son came and said ‘Yes Dad’. Son, you are going to be the next King of this Kingdom. You should take care of this kingdom. Saying this, Neman passed away. His son who was named Gabriel was very sad. He went and sat on his father’s throne. His mother Seema was sad too. Days passed, Once Gabriel",
      "fell ill. He and his mother went to the Doctor. The doctor ‘Gabriel has an allergy which can kill him soon’; if you take care then he can stay alive for more 13 days. Gabriel’s mother started crying. Gabriel consoled her. They both went to the palace. Days passed by, Gabriel was sleeping, his toe was itching, he couldn’t sleep at that night. The Death God appeared in front of",
      "him. Gabriel was afraid of him. The Death God asked what the matter is. Gabriel said, “I have an allergy. If I don’t take care of myself I can die in 3 more days. Saying this Gabriel was sobbing. The Death God consoled him and said.”You have more 3 days time. I promise I won’t take you to the Heaven. Gabriel thanked the God and the God disappeared. After 3 days the Death God came",
      "came back he said, “It is time for you to go with me Gabriel. Gabriel said, ‘You told you will never take me with you. The Death God replied, “I said that only to console you because you had 3 days time. It is my job to take people with me to the Heaven. Saying this Death God took Gabriel with him."
    ],
